# arm: massive
# 20% verbatim; rewrite freely, keep the thinking and the voice
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/massive/.
# bin/arm.sh promote massive folds these into profiles/base.env.

CURATE_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/rewrite-massive.md
VERBATIM_MIN=20
NEW_SLACK_EVERY=1
GLUE_MAX_WORDS=40
GATE_TRACE=1
# quotas deliberately absent: inherited from the base, so the only thing
# this arm changes is how it writes.
